OL,3,GSouth West
OL,4,
OL,5,CToday:FFine and mostly dry to start
OL,6,Fwith any morning showers quickly dying
OL,7,Fout. Sunny spells mainly in the east,
OL,8,Fbefore cloud and rain associated with
OL,9,FStorm Austen push into the southwest
OL,10,Fduring the afternoon. Winds picking up
OL,11,Fby evening.
OL,12,
OL,13,CTonight:FStorm Austen continues to
OL,14,Fbring heavy rain and strong winds.
OL,15,FNorthern parts may see a lull in winds
OL,16,Fin the early hours before gales push
OL,17,Finto Cornwall around dawn.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
OL,24,ANext Page  BWeather  CReg News  FReg TV
