OL,3,GSouth West
OL,4,
OL,5,CFriday:FRain to start for all areas
OL,6,Fbefore pushing away to the northeast
OL,7,Fthrough the morning. Strong winds
OL,8,Fcontinuing through the day with gales
OL,9,Falong coasts and exposed areas.
OL,10,
OL,11,COutlook for Saturday to Monday:FStrong
OL,12,Fwinds and heavy rain Saturday before a
OL,13,Fbrief settled interlude brings sunny
OL,14,Fspells on Sunday. Further wind and
OL,15,Frain arrives overnight into Monday.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
